n includes. The Fedwire Funds Service is the connection in scope for FHLB Cincinnati. More on ACI Connetic is at www.aciworldwide.com/solutions/payments-hub.\n\"Advance volume moves with what members need, and the payment behind it has to work every time. Connetic will give FHLB Cincinnati the ability to continue offering reliable payments in an efficient way with industry-leading technology,\" said Scotty Perkins, executive vice president, product management, payment software, ACI Worldwide. \"Our job is the platform. Theirs is the payments, and the members waiting on them.\"\nFHLB Cinc", "publisher": "yahoo.com", "discovered_published": "2026-09-30T10:30:00+00:00", "retrieved_at": "2026-10-04T19:31:53.691850+00:00", "text_sha256": "772c0ee941b069039dafe5db156bb7b82a5e2d3f4b4c6c23dfbfdaa5b79e0478"}
